# "Destroy all creatures" can be regenerated (CR 701.19, 614.8): in response, Bot2 regenerates one of its two Ornithopters with
# Yavimaya Hollow. The regenerated one is tapped and stays on the battlefield (a battlefield is not a zone the search
# looks in); the other dies, is exiled from Bot2's graveyard as the evidence-collected effect asks, and the Ornithopter in
# Bot2's hand and the one in its library are exiled with it. Bot2 draws one card for the one from its hand.

